<title>UK: JFM plans to launch $400 mln 10-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>JFM plans to launch $400 mln 10-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan Finance Corp for Municipal Enterprises (JFM) plans to launch a $400 million 10-year Eurobond, joint lead managers Merrill Lynch and Tokyo-Mitsubishi International (TMI) said on Friday.</p>
<p>JFM is guaranteed by Japan and carries triple-A credit ratings.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
